  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Public Financial Management basket support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;b&gt;The PFM 24-29 project&lt;/b&gt;, Public Financial Management basket supports Rwanda in its transformation to a well governed, climate resilient and inclusive welfare state. It supports Rwanda&apos;s socio-economic transformation through effective and accountable public finance management and pays close attention to integrating continuous attention and support for Public Finance Management (PFM) through a multi-donor basket approach.     Furthermore, the PFM programme remains actively engaged in supporting Rwandan public sector actors and development partners in broader PFM policy dialogue.</narrative>
  </description>
